WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.364
Open a new temporary chat and upload the chapter PDF.

00:00:04.364 --> 00:00:05.625
ChatGPT reads the uploaded chapter · accelerated.

00:00:05.625 --> 00:00:09.125
Write the prompt · fast typing.

00:00:09.125 --> 00:00:09.439
Send the shortcut as the second message.

00:00:09.439 --> 00:00:11.127
ChatGPT processes the prompt and builds the widget · accelerated.

00:00:11.127 --> 00:00:14.773
Inspect the generated widget before using its controls.

00:00:14.987 --> 00:00:20.094
Flip card 1 and read its concept or definition.

00:00:20.094 --> 00:00:22.690
Flip card 2 and read its concept or definition.

00:00:22.690 --> 00:00:27.195
Turn the unmatched pair back over before the next attempt.

00:00:27.195 --> 00:00:32.332
Flip card 3 and compare it with the cards already seen.

00:00:32.332 --> 00:00:34.935
Flip card 4 and compare it with the cards already seen.

00:00:34.935 --> 00:00:38.888
Turn the second unmatched pair back over.

00:00:38.888 --> 00:00:43.313
Return to the Context card remembered from the first attempt.

00:00:43.313 --> 00:00:48.767
Match it with the context definition remembered in card 4.

00:00:48.767 --> 00:00:52.066
Flip card 5 to search for the next known pair.

00:00:52.066 --> 00:00:57.518
Match the training definition in card 5 with the Training concept in card 3.

00:00:57.518 --> 00:01:02.566
Reveal the final unknown card and identify its concept.

00:01:02.566 --> 00:01:07.971
Match Inference with the definition remembered in card 1.

00:01:07.971 --> 00:01:13.784
Inspect the completed three-pair result and attempt counter.

00:01:13.784 --> 00:01:20.973
Restart the memory game with a fresh hidden board.
